From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:17:36 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] meshcore: add MeshCoreKmp feature module and transports

Add a dedicated feature module backed by com.darkrockstudios:meshcore. BLE uses MeshCoreKmp's BlueFalcon adapter; USB is exposed through the same BleAdapter interface using the app's UsbRepository, with MeshCore's USB CDC <\u003e framing handled by UsbMeshCoreConnection. The module is registered with Koin and kept independent of the Meshtastic node/message data.

